deiras sobre 'macho alfa' e 'fêmea beta' eram uma piada do casal.\",\"title\":\"VÍDEO: Oficial acusado de matar PM Gisele chora ao negar crime, diz que 'macho alfa' e 'fêmea beta' eram brincadeira do casal e que é 'escravo' na prisão\",\"url\":\"https://g1.globo.com/sp/sao-paulo/noticia/2026/09/27/video-oficial-acusado-de-matar-pm-gisele-chora-ao-negar-crime-diz-que-macho-alfa-e-femea-beta-eram-brincadeira-do-casal-e-que-e-escravo-na-prisao.ghtml\",\"video\":null},\"created\":\"2026-09-27T08:00:00.660Z\",\"feedId\":\"\",\"id\":\"1ede59a901a606a536a7cd87c78db15b\",\"lastPublication\":\"2026-09-27T08:00:01.613Z\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-27T08:00:01.613Z\",\"publication\":\"2026-09-27T08:00:00.660Z\",\"tenantId\":\"g1\",\"type\":\"materia\"},{\"_documentKey\":\"esid:conteudo_editorial_g1#multi-content#0e8b1bfd-7856-446a-9c70-8f9df9ad7550\",\"content\":{\"category\":\"b80f8cae-ba78-40e3-87c7-4064e3ffecfe\",\"chapeu\":{\"image\":{},\"label\":\"\"},\"image\":{\"cropOptions\":{},\"sizes\":{\"L\":{\"height\":608,\"url\":\"https://s2-g1.glbimg.com/6xeTl9BWJvln-sZ_89ns7R8NUHM=/1080x608/top/smart/https://i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_59edd422c0c84a879bd37670ae4f538a/internal_photos/bs/2026/e/I/JAke60StyIAJZBI3QBsw/presidente.png\",\"width\":1080},\"M\":{\"height\":456,\"url\":\"https://s2-g1.glbimg.com/vfMps1TJeMIed6tVRCf4RgxhRLU=/810x456/top/smart/https://i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_59edd422c0c84a879bd37670ae4f538a/internal_photos/bs/2026/e/I/JAke60StyIAJZBI3QBsw/presidente.png\",\"width\":810},\"Q\":{\"height\":94,\"url\":\"https://s2-g1.glbimg.com/Wm3-1-ZWMf50__p56lC1O-LMiqI=/94x94/top/smart/https://i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_59edd422c0c84a879bd37670ae4f538a/internal_photos/bs/2026/e/I/JAke60StyIAJZBI3QBsw/presidente.png\",\"width\":94},\"S\":{\"height\":304,\"url\":\"https://s2-g1.glbimg.com/hfQO0GYWUelol72QDq-KjUEQixk=/540x304/top/smart/https://i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_59edd422c0c84a879bd37670ae4f538a/internal_photos/bs/2026/e/I/JAke60StyIAJZBI3QBsw/presidente.png\",\"width\":540},\"V\"